
# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key

# Implementation source clones (large; per-clone provenance lives at
# references/manifest/clones/<name>.md, alongside the SOURCES.md manifest).
# Note: when an implementation is its own nested git repo (the usual
# case — RC3, TOPPS-janus, jana, etc. each ship as standalone clones),
# the parent repo cannot reach files INSIDE the nested .git. That is
# why the per-clone provenance lives outside the implementation tree,
# not inside it as a `<clone>/CLONE-INFO.md` file. Pre-existing
# `!references/implementations/<x>/CLONE-INFO.md` allow-rules in this
# .gitignore were structurally non-functional and have been removed
# 2026-05-26 (see bd bennettvm-zoe review + bennettvm-n52).
references/implementations/RC3/
references/implementations/TOPPS-janus/
references/implementations/jana/
references/implementations/janus-vesta/
references/implementations/evincarofautumn-janus/

# Playwright session artifacts (from acquisition sessions)
.playwright/
.playwright-cli/

# Lean4-skills plugin scaffolding (SessionStart hook)
.claude/docs/
.claude/tools/

# Julia Manifest carries machine-local dev-paths (Bennett.jl is dev'd
# from ../Bennett.jl until it's registered). Each developer regenerates
# their own Manifest via `Pkg.develop(path="../Bennett.jl"); Pkg.instantiate()`.
Manifest.toml
